{
    "8": {
        "lines": [
            "　　This is Makai.",
            "　　a giant kingdom located in the world of neverending agony, hell.",
        ]
    },
    "11": {
        "lines": [
            "　　Where monsters and humans are sent to overwork until they can pay for their sins.",
           "　　 It's creepy nature is satisfying for some, but agonizing for others.",
        ]
    },
    "16": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$Rudy:$12345678> \"...And that's how all of it went.\""
        ]
    },
    "22": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$Rudy$12345678> \"... Like, actually VERY obsessed with them.\""
        ]
    },
    "19": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$Rudy:$12345678> \"Your overlord is very obsessed with Holidays.\""
        ]
    },
    "25": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$Rudy:$12345678> \"...What a weird brat.\""
        ]
    },
    "28": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$Jeff:$12345678> \"I never expected YOU To even remotely be able to defeat overlord Kuri.\"",
            "<c$$12345678\"> \" You're just some girl that appeared out of nowhere.\"",
            "<c$Emer:$12345678> \"We thought you were gonna die the instant you entered her mansion.\"",
        ]
    },
    "32": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$Rudy:$12345678> \"Hehe.\""
        ]
    },
    "36": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$Sam:$12345678> \"Atleast you're here in one piece...\"",
            "<c$$12345678\"> \"somehow!\""
        ]
    },
    "39": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$Rudy:$12345678> \"Ehhhh? You guys were watching me all the time?\""
        ]
    },
    "42": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$Sam:$12345678> \"Yep.\""
        ]
    },
    "45": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$Sam:$12345678> \"We were looking from the other side of the windows!\""
        ]
    },
    "48": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$Jeff:$12345678> \"We even brought popcorn for the occasion.\"",
            "<c$$12345678\"> Believe me, we were pretty sure that damelie was gonna exterminate you.\""
        ]
    },
    "51": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$Emer:$12345678> \"And I even took videos with my camera!\""
        ]
    },
    "54": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$Rudy:$12345678> \"Thank for the help, eh.\""
        ]
    },
    "57": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$Sam:$12345678> \"Anyways, Are you enjoying the view?"
        ]
    },
    "60": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$Jeff:$12345678> \"We've been watching makai's sky for a while.\""
        ]
    },
    "64": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$Jeff:$12345678> \"Hell's view it's truly amazing from the top of the castle.",
            "<c$$12345678\"> How sad sinners can't enjoy it as much!\""
        ]
    },
    "68": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$Rudy:$12345678> \"I guess so.\""
        ]
    },
    "71": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$Rudy:$12345678> \"You demons got nice views.",
            "<c$$12345678\"> I still don't know why your overlord wanted to steal holidays.\""
        ]
    },
    "75": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$Jeff:$12345678> \"More variety wouldn't go bad."
        ]
    },
    "77": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$$12345678\"> don't you think?\""
        ]
    },
    "80": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$Emer:$12345678> \"Plus, Imagine how cool this place would look if winter existed in here!",
            "<c$$12345678\"> This place is always stuck in a dark autumn.\""
        ]
    },
    "84": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$Jeff:$12345678> \"Maybe we should get a job that requires making holiday decorations."
        ]
    },
    "86": {
        "lines": [
            "　　Sam nodded twice."
        ]
    },
    "88": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$$12345678\"> It'll have so much demand. We're gonna be rich!\""
        ]
    },
    "91": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$Rudy:$12345678> \"Whatever. Anyways, I'm going home.",
            "<c$$12345678\"> Good luck getting a new job.\""
        ]
    },
    "95": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$Jeff:$12345678> \"We'll totally get a self-hired one. Those are the most fun ones!\"",
        ]
    },
    "99": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$Rudy:$12345678> \"Ah, You're not wrong.\""
        ]
    },
    "102": {
        "lines": [
            "　　Rudy Understood makai's people way of thinking.",
            "　　Still, she will keep an eye on makai every now and then, knowing how they are."
        ]
    },
    "107": {
        "lines": [
            "　　Good Ending No. 4!",
            "　　\"The visitant from halloween and the Sadistic siblings.\""
        ]
    }
}